   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Given our strong first half performance and positive outlook, we are increasing our full year organic revenue growth guidance from 20 - 25% to around 30%.",
   "file": "20220511_CPG_Half-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-26",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We confirm our FY 2022 operating margin guidance of over 6% and now expect our exit margin to moderate slightly from around 7% due to the strong net new performance and ongoing inflationary pressures.",
